Two independent faults in two packages: discover returns the diagnostic from the
package earliest by import path (example.com/app before example.com/dep),
deterministically, no matter what order the loader presents the packages. Guards
the cross-package traversal ordering in Analyze. Without it, both the position
and the error kind flip with load order.
-- config --
import-path: example.com/app
package-name: app
error-is: ErrInvalidSetName
-- example.com/app/a.go --
package app

//plumb:build extra
func A() int { return 0 }
-- example.com/dep/b.go --
package dep

//plumb:build
const B = 1
